  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/191156564623444064-10-15-2020-1602790182.png\" alt=\"undefined\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/u6CVJrc\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/223938153260515328.svg?color=7289DA&label=discord&logo=discord&logoColor=FFFFFF&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Modding Legacy Discord Server\"> </a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fmoddinglegacy\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/ko--fi-support-FF5E5B?style=for-the-badge&logo=ko-fi&logoColor=white\" alt=\"If you like what we do, please consider supporting us on Ko-fi! Thank you!\"> </a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fneoforged.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/BUILT_WITH-NEOFORGE-d7742f?style=for-the-badge&logo=neoforge&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Built with NeoForge\"> </a> <br><br><a href=\"https://twitter.com/ModdingLegacy\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/ModdingLegacy?style=social\" alt=\"Follow us! ModdingLegacy Twitter\"> </a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbsky.app%252fprofile%252fmoddinglegacy.com\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/moddinglegacy.com-0285FF?logo=bluesky&logoColor=00&style=social\" alt=\"Follow us! moddinglegacy.com Bluesky\"> </a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/channel/UCUhDvKdbaKHrKvV5kcKqqiQ\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/youtube/channel/subscribers/UCUhDvKdbaKHrKvV5kcKqqiQ?sub_confirmation=1&style=social&label=@ModdingLegacy\" alt=\"Subscribe to us on YouTube!\"> </a></p>\n<p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-style:italic;text-align:center;font-weight:600\">一款簡單的模組，允許馬匹裝備終界箱。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 style=\"color:#7abf71;font-family:Palatino Linotype, sans-serif;line-height:2.5em;font-weight:600\">🐴 簡介</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif\">此模組僅允許任何馬匹裝備終界箱。這使得玩家可以在旅途中打開他們的終界箱。只要其他模組按照規範開發，箱子甚至應該會顯示在模組添加的馬匹上！</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/201007192748742768-10-15-2020-1602791378.png\" alt=\"Riding\"></p>\n<p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/709021337770268467-10-15-2020-1602791296.png\" alt=\"GUI\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"color:#7abf71;font-family:Palatino Linotype, sans-serif;line-height:2.5em;font-weight:600\">🧪 模組兼容性</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/good-nights-sleep\" rel=\"nofollow\">Good Night's Sleep</a> -- <strong>兼容</strong>。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif\">此模組添加了獨角獸，並且與 Ender Chested 完美配合。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wings-horns-hooves-the-ultimate-unicorn-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wings Horns &amp; Hooves, the Ultimate Unicorn Mod</a> -- <strong>兼容</strong>。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif\">它可以工作，但你必須對其自定義馬匹 <em>SHIFT + 右鍵點擊</em>，因為它們的 GUI 覆蓋了 Ender Chested 的界面。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/realistic-horse-genetics\" rel=\"nofollow\">Realistic Horse Genetics</a> -- <strong>兼容</strong> 但有缺陷。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif\">它可以按預期功能運行，但終界箱不會在其馬匹上渲染。</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"color:#f00;font-size:2.5em\"><span style=\"display:inline;font-size:1.1em;line-height:1em\"><strong>🤚 支援：如果您對我們的模組有任何問題或疑問，請閱讀常見問題解答！您也可以<a style=\"display:inline;color:#f00;font-size:1.3em;text-decoration:underline\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgitlab.com%252fgroups%252fmodding-legacy%252f-%252fissues\" rel=\"nofollow\">在問題追蹤器中提交問題</a>，或者加入我們的 Discord 伺服器，我們可以為您提供幫助！</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/u6CVJrc\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://discordapp.com/api/guilds/223938153260515328/widget.png?style=banner3\" alt=\"Modding Legacy Discord Server\"></a></p>",
